\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
DeepRobotics Jueying Lite3 \'97 Operating from a web browser\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 No software installation is required on the operating device (phone, tablet or laptop). The device only needs to be on the 
\f0\b same network as the console computer
\f1\b0 : the robot's Wi-Fi (192.168.2.x) or the same LAN (192.168.1.x).\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 1. Requirements\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 	\'95	\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
The console computer is powered on, on the robot's Wi-Fi or on the same LAN, and the Lite3 Pilot console is running (it serves the web interface on port 
\f0\b 8123
\f1\b0 ).\
\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 	\'95	\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Your device (phone/tablet/laptop) is:\
\pard\pardeftab720\li1440\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 	\uc0\u9702 	\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
on the 
\f0\b robot's Wi-Fi
\f1\b0  (the hotspot from the robot's QR label), or\
\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 	\uc0\u9702 	\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
on the 
\f0\b same LAN
\f1\b0  as the console computer.\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 	\'95	\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
No web server, no VPN, no internet access is needed \'97 everything is local.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 2. Find the console address\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 	1	\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
On the console computer, the address to use is its own IP on the network that your device shares:\
\pard\pardeftab720\li1440\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 	\uc0\u9702 	\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
on the robot's Wi-Fi: e.g. 192.168.2.22\
\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 	\uc0\u9702 	\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
on the same LAN: e.g. 192.168.1.210\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 	2	\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Console URL format: 
\f0\b http://<console-computer-IP>:8123
\f1\b0 \uc0\u8232 Example: http://192.168.2.22:8123\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 3. Open and connect\
