\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 	1	\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Open that URL in the browser on your device.\
\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 	2	\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Check the robot IP shown under 
\f0\b Advanced \uc0\u8594  Robot IP
\f1\b0 : it must be the motion host of the network you are on:\
\pard\pardeftab720\li1440\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 	\uc0\u9702 	\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
robot Wi-Fi: 
\f0\b 192.168.2.1
\f1\b0 \
\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 	\uc0\u9702 	\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
ethernet/LAN: 
\f0\b 192.168.1.120
\f1\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 	3	\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Press 
\f0\b \uc0\u55357 \u56588  Connect
\f1\b0 . Wait for 
